        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "f6ce0090-b78a-32ba-ac97-ab89915fcdc8",
                "word": "je-sais-tout",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2a1a14d6-ef8e-3088-9e57-be59f83f5b64",
                        "entry_id": "f6ce0090-b78a-32ba-ac97-ab89915fcdc8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Personne qui semble ou fait semblant de tout savoir."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "ironic"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "937b1120-6fa9-45a6-9f1c-fcae385c1706",
                                "sense_id": "2a1a14d6-ef8e-3088-9e57-be59f83f5b64",
                                "text": "Parfois, un je-sais-tout intervient dans le débat, qu’il écrase de sa sérénité clairvoyante de voyageur mondialiste. « Ne croyez pas ça ! C’est partout pareil. »"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2ff8b9e3-b10c-4f15-9881-0a491d34ccda",
                                "sense_id": "2a1a14d6-ef8e-3088-9e57-be59f83f5b64",
                                "text": "Il y a le moulin à paroles, le \"je-sais-tout\" qui prend tout le monde de haut, l'irascible... S'ils apportent de la vie au bureau, à la longue, ils vous saoulent."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "01450ce8-11ac-4d8f-ae57-3645e183602a",
                                "sense_id": "2a1a14d6-ef8e-3088-9e57-be59f83f5b64",
                                "text": "Quand on clarifie et qu'on corrige, on devient une je-sais-tout arrogante que personne ne peut supporter."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "696ee4c1-1459-4bf8-a9fa-264ae0916405",
                        "source_entry_id": "f6ce0090-b78a-32ba-ac97-ab89915fcdc8",
                        "source_sense_id": "2a1a14d6-ef8e-3088-9e57-be59f83f5b64",
                        "target_lang_word": "Besserwisser",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Besserwisser",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d350449a-a6ac-3c6d-ab4c-eb18a5344683",
                                        "entry_id": "8b9639e1-ad17-30b5-b8d4-ed9262e389a8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Person, die immer alles besser wissen will und damit angibt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33e58b41-85bb-47e1-ac38-45ba3f7aac56",
                                                "sense_id": "d350449a-a6ac-3c6d-ab4c-eb18a5344683",
                                                "text": "Er ist ein solcher Besserwisser, dass nicht einmal die Lehrer mit ihm diskutieren mögen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa9269af-bbaa-41f5-aef2-09845e1ab125",
                                                "sense_id": "d350449a-a6ac-3c6d-ab4c-eb18a5344683",
                                                "text": "„Auch in Meister Pfriem setzten die Brüder Grimm einem Nörgler, Besserwisser und Rechthaber par excellence ein unvergessliches Denkmal …“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b61b2efd-7405-4f2d-8a36-d1f90f3bd6cd",
                                                "sense_id": "d350449a-a6ac-3c6d-ab4c-eb18a5344683",
                                                "text": "„Gewiss trat Wieland nicht als spröder Besserwisser auf.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "54ba4780-5386-4f29-a184-71a3a469ef05",
                        "source_entry_id": "f6ce0090-b78a-32ba-ac97-ab89915fcdc8",
                        "source_sense_id": "2a1a14d6-ef8e-3088-9e57-be59f83f5b64",
                        "target_lang_word": "know-it-all",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "know-it-all",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3534794d-36c0-3b8b-917d-7c179f75bed3",
                                        "entry_id": "48997a31-671a-33a0-90fc-cd6feed3cb03",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone who claims to be knowledgeable or an expert in something, obnoxiously dismissing the opinions, advice, suggestions, etc. of others."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf016736-4c72-4391-ad4b-c22155769364",
                                                "sense_id": "3534794d-36c0-3b8b-917d-7c179f75bed3",
                                                "text": "We had it all figured out, but this know-it-all marched in with \"the correct way of solving it\", leaving our experiment in shambles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b29b6c0-5872-4d55-a50c-a87bf476679f",
                                                "sense_id": "3534794d-36c0-3b8b-917d-7c179f75bed3",
                                                "text": "The same holds true for supporting details—they help you to learn more about a topic. Be a know it all by sharing these details and supporting details with friends."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8dff8c7-0369-47d7-a6bd-cb9119d566b4",
                                                "sense_id": "3534794d-36c0-3b8b-917d-7c179f75bed3",
                                                "text": "She's a mean, bossy know-it-all."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c805bc4-3c1b-43d9-9e7c-9df2268b71fd",
                                                "sense_id": "3534794d-36c0-3b8b-917d-7c179f75bed3",
                                                "text": "Have you ever gone shopping with a Know-It-All girlfriend and she insists, without your consent or consulting you first, to choose your outfits for you?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
